{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Village Defenders \u2013 A strategic 2D roguelike game. You must protect your peaceful village from hordes of zombies and skeletons! Act smart, unlock unique abilities, and upgrade your equipment to fend off waves of undead.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590540/extras/gif1.gif?t=1749480568\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Plan your defences wisely\u2014each level introduces new challenges and tougher foes. Will you hold the line, or will your village fall? Rally your forces, master the art of defence, and become the hero your people need!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd39 Learn &amp; Upgrade \u2013 Enhance your defender with unique abilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd39 Diverse Enemies \u2013 Face waves of foes, each with different strengths and weaknesses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd39 Strategic Depth \u2013 Try different equipment to adapt your tactics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd39 Epic Boss Battles \u2013 Test your defences against a massive, fearsome boss.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd39 Endless Mode \u2013 How long can you survive against infinite waves?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defend your home\u2014Village Defenders awaits your command! \ud83c\udfe1\u2694\ufe0f\ud83d\udee1</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590540/extras/gif3-2.gif?t=1749480568\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590540?t=1749480568","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590540?t=1749480568","capsule_image